  "Comment": {
    "type": "cexostring",
    "value": "Sowing Discord in Bree first-completion reward (roadmap: sowing-discord-bree), given once by q_sow_pay (repeat completions pay gold + XP only). Mirrors the prestige-reward power tier -- three +3 properties, no AB/damage, forge-cap-safe: Bluff +3 (PropertyName 52 skill bonus, CostTable 25, Subtype SKILL_BLUFF = 23), Hide +3 (Subtype SKILL_HIDE = 5), Saving Throw Bonus vs Fear +3 (PropertyName 40, CostTable 2, Subtype IP_CONST_SAVEVS_FEAR = 8) -- all constants verified in ovr/nwscript.nss. BaseItem 80 + ModelPart1 58 copied from the module's existing Cloak of Bravery."
  },
  "Cost": {
    "type": "dword",
    "value": 0
  },
  "Cursed": {
    "type": "byte",
    "value": 0
  },
  "DescIdentified": {
    "type": "cexolocstring",
    "value": {
      "0": "A traveling cloak the grey-black of a rainy dusk, woven -- so Ferny swears, in the tone of a man repeating a price rather than a fact -- from thread spun in the shadow of Minas Morgul. It hangs wrong for honest cloth: folds settle where a watcher's eye slides past, and the wearer's voice comes out smooth on even the ugliest lie. Whatever was paid for it was not paid in silver, morgul or otherwise."
    }
  },
